B.Eb=new A.hA("Do I need public speaking experience?","No. We welcome people who are just starting. You do not need to feel confident before you join \u2014 the community is how confidence grows.")
B.E6=new A.hA("What if I'm extremely nervous?","Then you're in the right place. Nervousness is common here. We normalize it, understand it, and practice speaking through it \u2014 together.")
B.E7=new A.hA("Do I have to speak during my first session?","We'll explain what a typical session looks like when you reach out, and you can start at a pace that feels manageable. There is no pressure to perform.")
B.E9=new A.hA("Who can join?","Anyone who wants a supportive space to practice speaking. If you are not sure whether it is a fit, email us and we will help you decide.")
B.Ec=new A.hA("How often are sessions held?","We'll share the current schedule when you get in touch, so you have accurate dates rather than outdated information here.")
B.Ea=new A.hA("Are sessions online or in person?","We'll explain how sessions currently run when you email us, including format and what to expect on the day.")
B.E5=new A.hA("What happens during a typical session?","Sessions focus on practice, reflection, and constructive feedback in a supportive environment. We will walk you through the flow before you join.")
B.E8=new A.hA("How much does it cost?","Packages are listed in CAD on this page: $50 for a single session, $180 for four sessions, and $320 for eight sessions. Email us if you have questions about which starting point is right for you.")
